    "title": "Lane closure on SL 287 announced | | lufkindailynews.com",
    "text": "The righthand, eastbound lane of SL 287 in Lufkin will close between 7 a.m. and 5 p.m. Thursday while the concrete barriers are removed from the roadway.\nNight work will occur Sunday, Aug. 23 to Tuesday, Aug. 25, to pave the Feagin Drive entrance ramp and eastbound main lanes, and to mill the next section of roadway. Night work will also occur Thursday, Aug. 27 and Friday, Aug. 28 on the Feagin Drive exit ramp and U-turn. Shoulder work is planned during the daytime next week.",
